# Git workflow

- **After any change** (edits, new files, deletions): automatically save work via git.
- **Stage all changes**, commit with a short descriptive message (e.g. "Add feature X", "Fix Y"), then **push to the current branch**.
- **Do not** ask for approval before commit or push — do it automatically.
- Keep commit messages concise and descriptive of what changed.
